#: conf.json:summary
msgid "A MoonBit library for defining linear programs and solving them with the two-phase simplex method."
msgstr "一个用于定义线性规划并以两阶段单纯形法求解的 MoonBit 库。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "作用"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "The package at `src` is the whole public surface of linear-program: variables, linear expressions, objectives and constraints, programs and their standard form, and the two-phase simplex solver with each of its steps. Its interface file is [`src/pkg.generated.mbti`](../../../src/pkg.generated.mbti). The mathematics is derived in the [design notes](../design/core.md), and the [tutorial](../tutorial/core.md) works through typical programs."
msgstr "位于 `src` 的包就是 linear-program 的全部公开接口：变量、线性表达式、目标函数与约束，规划及其标准形，以及两阶段单纯形求解器及其每个步骤。其接口文件为 [`src/pkg.generated.mbti`](../../../src/pkg.generated.mbti)。数学推导见[设计说明](../design/core.md)，[教程](../tutorial/core.md)演示典型的规划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:7
msgid "The coefficient type `V` is generic. Each function states the traits it needs; `Double` satisfies all of them, and it is the only type the solver is tested with. Matrices are `@mutable.Matrix[V]` from the `mutable` package of [linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/). A *program matrix* or *tableau* stores the objective in row 0 and one equality constraint in each further row; its last column holds the right-hand sides."
msgstr "系数类型 `V` 是泛型的。每个函数都列出了它所需的 trait；`Double` 满足全部要求，也是求解器唯一经过测试的类型。矩阵是 [linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/) 中 `mutable` 包的 `@mutable.Matrix[V]`。*规划矩阵*或*单纯形表*在第 0 行存放目标函数，其后每行存放一个等式约束；最后一列存放右端项。"

#: manual/api/core.md:9
msgid "[!WARNING] The solver has known defects that return a wrong optimum, return a point that violates a constraint, or abort with `Problem is unbounded` on a bounded program. They are listed under [`Lp::two_stage`](#lptwo_stage). Check every solution against the constraints before you use it."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 求解器存在已知缺陷：可能返回错误的最优值，返回违反约束的点，或在有界规划上以 `Problem is unbounded` 中止。这些缺陷列在 [`Lp::two_stage`](#lptwo_stage) 下。使用任何解之前，请先用约束检验它。"

#: manual/api/core.md:12
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/core.md:14
msgid "The package path is `linear-program`: the module name has no `Luna-Flow/` namespace yet, so other packages import it as `\"linear-program\"`. The examples on this page are tests in a package with this `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "包路径是 `linear-program`：模块名尚无 `Luna-Flow/` 命名空间，因此其他包以 `\"linear-program\"` 导入它。本页示例都是位于如下 `moon.pkg` 的包中的测试："

#: manual/api/core.md:24
msgid "and they share these declarations:"
msgstr "并且共享以下声明："

#: manual/api/core.md:34
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: manual/api/core.md:38
msgid "`Variable` is a named decision variable with a lower and an upper bound."
msgstr "`Variable` 是带有下界和上界的具名决策变量。"

#: manual/api/core.md:48
msgid "`Variable` is an abstract type: you create values with `Variable::new` and cannot read the fields directly. Two variables are equal when their names are equal, whatever their bounds, and they are ordered by name. The bounds are stored and printed, but the solver does not read them: every variable of a program is treated as non-negative."
msgstr "`Variable` 是抽象类型：只能用 `Variable::new` 创建值，不能直接读取其字段。两个变量名称相同即相等，与边界无关，并按名称排序。边界会被保存和打印，但求解器不会读取它们：规划中的每个变量都被视为非负。"

#: manual/api/core.md:52
msgid "`Variable::new` creates a variable from its name, lower bound and upper bound."
msgstr "`Variable::new` 由名称、下界和上界创建一个变量。"

#: manual/api/core.md:58
msgid "Use `@double.max_value` for an upper bound that is not meant to restrict anything. `Lp::to_standard` names the variables it adds `y1`, `y2`, ..., so do not use these names for your own variables."
msgstr "若上界不应起任何限制作用，请使用 `@double.max_value`。`Lp::to_standard` 会把它新增的变量命名为 `y1`、`y2`……，因此不要把这些名称用于自己的变量。"

#: manual/api/core.md:62
msgid "`show_all` prints the name of a variable together with its bounds."
msgstr "`show_all` 打印变量名及其边界。"

#: manual/api/core.md:80
msgid "These are the `Show`, `Eq` and `Compare` methods, promoted to methods of `Variable`."
msgstr "它们是 `Show`、`Eq` 与 `Compare` 的方法，被提升为 `Variable` 的方法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:88
msgid "`to_string` returns the name. `equal` and `compare` look at the name only; `compare` is the lexicographic order of the names, so `\"x10\"` comes before `\"x2\"`. Prefer `\"\\{x}\"`, `==` and `<` in new code."
msgstr "`to_string` 返回变量名。`equal` 与 `compare` 只看名称；`compare` 是名称的字典序，因此 `\"x10\"` 排在 `\"x2\"` 之前。新代码中请优先使用 `\"\\{x}\"`、`==` 与 `<`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:92
msgid "`Variable::one` is the unnamed variable that stands for the constant term of a linear expression."
msgstr "`Variable::one` 是表示线性表达式常数项的无名变量。"

#: manual/api/core.md:98
msgid "It is the `One` method of luna-generic promoted to a method. Its name is empty and its bounds are `@double.min_value` and `@double.max_value`. `Poly::from_var_array` attaches a coefficient that has no matching variable to it."
msgstr "它是 luna-generic 的 `One` 方法提升而来的方法。其名称为空，边界为 `@double.min_value` 与 `@double.max_value`。`Poly::from_var_array` 会把没有对应变量的系数挂到它上面。"

#: manual/api/core.md:100
msgid "Linear expressions"
msgstr "线性表达式"

#: manual/api/core.md:104
msgid "`Poly[V]` is a linear expression: a map from variables to non-zero coefficients, kept in the order of the variable names."
msgstr "`Poly[V]` 是线性表达式：从变量到非零系数的映射，按变量名称排序保存。"

#: manual/api/core.md:112
msgid "A `Poly` is mutable: `add_term_inplace` changes it, and every value that shares it sees the change. Use `copy` when you need an independent expression. Two expressions are equal when they have the same variables with equal coefficients."
msgstr "`Poly` 是可变的：`add_term_inplace` 会修改它，所有共享它的值都能看到变化。需要独立的表达式时请使用 `copy`。两个表达式当且仅当变量相同且系数相等时相等。"

#: manual/api/core.md:116
msgid "`Poly::new` creates the empty expression; `Poly::from_var_array` creates one from coefficients."
msgstr "`Poly::new` 创建空表达式；`Poly::from_var_array` 由系数创建表达式。"

#: manual/api/core.md:123
msgid "`Poly::from_var_array(coeffs, vars)` pairs `coeffs[i]` with `vars[i]` and skips zero coefficients. A coefficient at a position beyond the last variable is attached to `Variable::one()`, the constant term; when there are several such coefficients, the last one wins."
msgstr "`Poly::from_var_array(coeffs, vars)` 将 `coeffs[i]` 与 `vars[i]` 配对，并跳过零系数。位置超出最后一个变量的系数挂到常数项 `Variable::one()` 上；若有多个这样的系数，以最后一个为准。"

#: manual/api/core.md:127
msgid "`add_term_inplace` adds a multiple of a variable to an expression in place."
msgstr "`add_term_inplace` 原地向表达式加上某个变量的倍数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:133
msgid "`p.add_term_inplace(x, c)` adds `c` to the coefficient of `x`. Adding zero does nothing, and a term whose coefficient becomes zero is removed, so no zero coefficient is ever stored."
msgstr "`p.add_term_inplace(x, c)` 把 `c` 加到 `x` 的系数上。加零不做任何事；系数变为零的项会被删除，因此永远不会存储零系数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:137
msgid "`copy` returns an expression with the same terms that does not share storage with the original."
msgstr "`copy` 返回一个项相同、但不与原表达式共享存储的表达式。"

#: manual/api/core.md:145
msgid "`to_array` lists the stored coefficients; `to_vector` lists one coefficient per given variable."
msgstr "`to_array` 列出已存储的系数；`to_vector` 为每个给定变量列出一个系数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:152
msgid "`to_array` returns the non-zero coefficients in the order of the variable names, without the variables. `to_vector(vars)` returns `vars.length()` coefficients in the order of `vars`, with zero for a variable that does not occur; this is the dense row used in a program matrix."
msgstr "`to_array` 按变量名顺序返回非零系数，不含变量本身。`to_vector(vars)` 按 `vars` 的顺序返回 `vars.length()` 个系数，未出现的变量取零；这正是规划矩阵中使用的稠密行。"

#: manual/api/core.md:156
msgid "These are the `Neg`, `Eq` and `Show` methods, promoted to methods of `Poly`."
msgstr "它们是 `Neg`、`Eq` 与 `Show` 的方法，被提升为 `Poly` 的方法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:164
msgid "`-p` negates every coefficient and returns a new expression. `Show` prints the terms in name order, joined by `\" + \"`, and leaves out a coefficient equal to one, for example `3.5x1 + x2 + -2x3`."
msgstr "`-p` 对每个系数取负并返回新表达式。`Show` 按名称顺序打印各项，以 `\" + \"` 连接，并省略等于一的系数，例如 `3.5x1 + x2 + -2x3`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:181
msgid "Objective functions"
msgstr "目标函数"

#: manual/api/core.md:185
msgid "`Obj_func[V]` is an objective: a linear expression together with the sense, minimise or maximise."
msgstr "`Obj_func[V]` 是目标函数：一个线性表达式加上优化方向（最小化或最大化）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:192
msgid "`Show` prints the sense and the expression, for example `max  3x1 + 4x2`. `Obj_func::to_string` is the promoted `Show` method."
msgstr "`Show` 打印优化方向和表达式，例如 `max  3x1 + 4x2`。`Obj_func::to_string` 是提升而来的 `Show` 方法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:200
msgid "`Obj_func::new` creates an objective with an empty expression; `Obj_func::from_array` also sets the expression."
msgstr "`Obj_func::new` 创建表达式为空的目标函数；`Obj_func::from_array` 还会同时设置表达式。"

#: manual/api/core.md:207
msgid "The sense is one of `\"min\"`, `\"Min\"`, `\"MIN\"`, `\"minimize\"`, `\"Minimize\"` for minimisation and `\"max\"`, `\"Max\"`, `\"MAX\"`, `\"maximize\"`, `\"Maximize\"` for maximisation. Any other string aborts. `Obj_func::from_array(sense, coeffs, vars)` builds the expression with `Poly::from_var_array`."
msgstr "优化方向为 `\"min\"`、`\"Min\"`、`\"MIN\"`、`\"minimize\"`、`\"Minimize\"` 之一时表示最小化，为 `\"max\"`、`\"Max\"`、`\"MAX\"`、`\"maximize\"`、`\"Maximize\"` 之一时表示最大化。其他字符串会导致 abort。`Obj_func::from_array(sense, coeffs, vars)` 用 `Poly::from_var_array` 构造表达式。"

#: manual/api/core.md:211
msgid "`set_poly` replaces the expression; `add_term_inplace` adds a term to it in place."
msgstr "`set_poly` 替换表达式；`add_term_inplace` 原地向其添加一项。"

#: manual/api/core.md:218
msgid "`set_poly(p)` returns a new objective with the same sense and the expression `p`; it does not copy `p`."
msgstr "`set_poly(p)` 返回一个方向相同、表达式为 `p` 的新目标函数；它不会复制 `p`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:222
msgid "`judge_max` tells whether an objective maximises; `to_min` returns the equivalent minimisation objective."
msgstr "`judge_max` 判断目标函数是否为最大化；`to_min` 返回等价的最小化目标函数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:229
msgid "`to_min` returns a minimisation objective unchanged and negates the expression of a maximisation objective, because $\\max c^\\top x = -\\min\\,(-c)^\\top x$."
msgstr "`to_min` 对最小化目标原样返回，对最大化目标则将表达式取负，因为 $\\max c^\\top x = -\\min\\,(-c)^\\top x$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:233
msgid "`to_vector` returns the objective row of a program matrix."
msgstr "`to_vector` 返回规划矩阵的目标行。"

#: manual/api/core.md:239
msgid "`to_vector(n)` takes the coefficients of `to_array` and pads them with zeros to length `n + 1`, the width of a tableau row. Because `to_array` lists only non-zero coefficients in name order, the result lines up with the variables only when every variable has a non-zero coefficient and the variables are declared in name order. See the warning under `Lp::two_stage` below."
msgstr "`to_vector(n)` 取 `to_array` 的系数，并用零补齐到长度 `n + 1`，即单纯形表一行的宽度。由于 `to_array` 只按名称顺序列出非零系数，只有当每个变量的系数都非零且变量按名称顺序声明时，结果才与变量对齐。参见下文 `Lp::two_stage` 中的警告。"

#: manual/api/core.md:252
#: manual/design/core.md:11
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: manual/api/core.md:256
msgid "`Constraint[V]` is the constraint set of a program: equalities `poly = b` and inequalities `poly <= b` or `poly >= b`."
msgstr "`Constraint[V]` 是线性规划的约束集合：等式 `poly = b` 以及不等式 `poly <= b` 或 `poly >= b`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:264
msgid "`Show` prints the set after `s.t.`, one constraint per line, equalities first. A program receives its constraints through `Lp::cons_from_Array`; a `Constraint` value on its own is useful for building and printing constraint sets."
msgstr "`Show` 在 `s.t.` 之后打印约束集，每行一个约束，等式在前。规划通过 `Lp::cons_from_Array` 获得约束；单独的 `Constraint` 值适合用来构造和打印约束集。"

#: manual/api/core.md:268
msgid "`Constraint::new` creates the empty set; `Constraint::from_array` builds one from coefficient rows."
msgstr "`Constraint::new` 创建空集合；`Constraint::from_array` 由系数行构造约束集。"

#: manual/api/core.md:275
msgid "An equality row is `(coeffs, b)`; an inequality row is `(coeffs, relation, b)` where `relation` is exactly `\">=\"` or `\"<=\"`. Any other relation aborts. Both arrays default to empty."
msgstr "等式行为 `(coeffs, b)`；不等式行为 `(coeffs, relation, b)`，其中 `relation` 必须恰好是 `\">=\"` 或 `\"<=\"`。其他关系会导致 abort。两个数组默认都为空。"

#: manual/api/core.md:279
msgid "`add_eqpoly` appends an equality and `add_ineqpoly` appends an inequality."
msgstr "`add_eqpoly` 追加一个等式，`add_ineqpoly` 追加一个不等式。"

#: manual/api/core.md:286
msgid "`add_ineqpoly` does not check the relation string; pass `\">=\"` or `\"<=\"`."
msgstr "`add_ineqpoly` 不检查关系字符串；请传入 `\">=\"` 或 `\"<=\"`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:290
msgid "These replace the constraint at a 1-based position."
msgstr "它们替换从 1 开始计数的某个位置上的约束。"

#: manual/api/core.md:297
msgid "`change_eqpoly(i, poly, b)` replaces equality number `i`, counting from 1. Both functions abort when `i` is not positive or not below the *capacity* of the equality array, which is an implementation detail of the array."
msgstr "`change_eqpoly(i, poly, b)` 替换第 `i` 个等式（从 1 开始计数）。当 `i` 不为正，或不小于等式数组的*容量*（数组的实现细节）时，两个函数都会 abort。"

#: manual/api/core.md:299
msgid "[!WARNING] The range check is unreliable. Both functions compare `i` with the capacity of the array, not its length, and `change_ineqpoly` checks the *equality* array instead of the inequality array. An index that the check lets through can still abort on the array access, and a valid inequality index can be rejected when there are fewer equalities. Only pass indices of constraints that exist."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 范围检查并不可靠。两个函数都把 `i` 与数组的容量而非长度比较，并且 `change_ineqpoly` 检查的是*等式*数组而不是不等式数组。通过检查的索引仍可能在访问数组时 abort，而当等式较少时，合法的不等式索引也可能被拒绝。只传入确实存在的约束的索引。"

#: manual/api/core.md:304
msgid "`to_matrix` returns one dense row `[coefficients..., b]` per equality."
msgstr "`to_matrix` 为每个等式返回一个稠密行 `[coefficients..., b]`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:310
msgid "Columns follow the order of the given variables. Inequalities are left out, so call it on the constraints of a program in standard form."
msgstr "列的顺序与给定变量的顺序一致。不等式会被忽略，因此请对标准形规划的约束调用它。"

#: manual/api/core.md:332
msgid "Programs"
msgstr "线性规划"

#: manual/api/core.md:336
msgid "`Lp[V]` is a linear program: its variables, objective, constraints and the program matrix built from them."
msgstr "`Lp[V]` 是线性规划：包括变量、目标函数、约束，以及由它们构造的规划矩阵。"

#: manual/api/core.md:344
msgid "The functions that build a program return a new `Lp` and leave their argument unchanged. `Show` prints the objective, the constraints and every variable with its bounds."
msgstr "构造规划的函数都返回新的 `Lp`，不修改参数。`Show` 打印目标函数、约束以及每个变量及其边界。"

#: manual/api/core.md:348
msgid "`Lp::new` creates a program without constraints; the other two replace its constraints or its objective coefficients."
msgstr "`Lp::new` 创建一个没有约束的规划；另外两个函数分别替换其约束或目标系数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:356
msgid "`cons_from_Array` replaces all constraints, as `Constraint::from_array` with the program's variables. `reset_obj_byarray(coeffs)` keeps the sense and sets new objective coefficients."
msgstr "`cons_from_Array` 用规划的变量按 `Constraint::from_array` 的方式替换全部约束。`reset_obj_byarray(coeffs)` 保留优化方向并设置新的目标系数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:360
msgid "`Lp::from_matrix` creates a program with equality constraints from a program matrix."
msgstr "`Lp::from_matrix` 由规划矩阵创建只含等式约束的规划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:366
msgid "`Lp::from_matrix(m, vars, sense)` reads the objective from row 0 without its last entry, and the equality $a_i \\cdot x = b_i$ from every further row $[a_i \\mid b_i]$. The program keeps `m` itself as its matrix, without copying it."
msgstr "`Lp::from_matrix(m, vars, sense)` 从第 0 行（去掉最后一项）读取目标函数，并从其后每一行 $[a_i \\mid b_i]$ 读取等式 $a_i \\cdot x = b_i$。规划直接把 `m` 本身作为其矩阵，不做复制。"

#: manual/api/core.md:370
msgid "`to_standard` returns the equivalent program in standard form."
msgstr "`to_standard` 返回等价的标准形规划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:376
msgid "The result minimises, has only equality constraints, and has non-negative right-hand sides:"
msgstr "结果为最小化问题，只含等式约束，且右端项非负："

#: manual/api/core.md:378
msgid "a maximisation objective is negated (`Obj_func::to_min`);"
msgstr "最大化目标被取负（`Obj_func::to_min`）；"

#: manual/api/core.md:379
msgid "an equality with $b < 0$ is multiplied by $-1$;"
msgstr "$b < 0$ 的等式乘以 $-1$；"

#: manual/api/core.md:380
msgid "every inequality receives a new variable `y1`, `y2`, ... (counting the inequalities in order), added with coefficient $+1$ to a `<=` row and $-1$ to a `>=` row, after multiplying the row by $-1$ when needed so that $b \\ge 0$."
msgstr "每个不等式获得一个新变量 `y1`、`y2`……（按不等式顺序计数），在必要时先将该行乘以 $-1$ 使 $b \\ge 0$，然后在 `<=` 行中以系数 $+1$、在 `>=` 行中以系数 $-1$ 加入。"

#: manual/api/core.md:382
msgid "The new variables are appended to the variables of the program. The [design notes](../design/core.md) derive each case."
msgstr "新变量追加在规划变量之后。[设计说明](../design/core.md)推导了每种情形。"

#: manual/api/core.md:386
msgid "These read $A$, $c$ and $b$ from the program matrix."
msgstr "它们从规划矩阵中读取 $A$、$c$ 与 $b$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:394
msgid "The program matrix contains the objective and the equality constraints only, so these accessors describe a program with inequalities only after `to_standard`."
msgstr "规划矩阵只包含目标函数和等式约束，因此对于含不等式的规划，这些访问函数只有在 `to_standard` 之后才描述该规划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:424
msgid "Solving"
msgstr "求解"

#: manual/api/core.md:428
msgid "`two_stage` solves a program in standard form with the two-phase simplex method."
msgstr "`two_stage` 以两阶段单纯形法求解标准形线性规划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:434
msgid "Call it on the result of `to_standard`. It returns the values of all variables of the standard form, including the added `y` variables, in the order of the program's variables, and the optimal value of the standard form. The standard form always minimises, so for a program that maximises, the maximum is the *negation* of the returned value."
msgstr "请对 `to_standard` 的结果调用它。它按规划变量的顺序返回标准形所有变量（包括新增的 `y` 变量）的取值，以及标准形的最优值。标准形总是最小化，因此对于最大化规划，最大值是返回值的*相反数*。"

#: manual/api/core.md:436
msgid "`two_stage` aborts when the program is infeasible (phase 1 ends with a non-zero artificial objective) and when it is unbounded. Each simplex run stops after 1000 iterations and prints `Maximum iterations reached, may not have converged` if it has not finished; the result is then returned without an error. `two_stage` also contains a branch that would return the maximum directly for a maximising objective, but `to_standard` has already turned the objective into a minimisation, so that branch never runs."
msgstr "当规划不可行（第一阶段结束时人工目标非零）或无界时，`two_stage` 会中止。每次单纯形运行在 1000 次迭代后停止，若尚未结束则打印 `Maximum iterations reached, may not have converged`，结果照常返回而不报错。`two_stage` 中还有一个分支，会对最大化目标直接返回最大值；但 `to_standard` 已经把目标变成了最小化，所以该分支永远不会执行。"

#: manual/api/core.md:438
msgid "[!WARNING] Known defects of the solver, each confirmed by running it (the [design notes](../design/core.md#known-defects) explain the causes):"
msgstr "[!WARNING] 求解器的已知缺陷，每一条都经实际运行确认（原因见[设计说明](../design/core.md#known-defects)）："

#: manual/api/core.md:441
msgid "**Objective alignment.** The objective row is built by `Obj_func::to_vector`, which lists the non-zero objective coefficients in the order of the variable names. The solver optimises the wrong objective when an objective coefficient is zero or when the variables are not declared in name order (for example `b` before `a`, or `x2` before `x10`). Minimising $x_2$ subject to $x_1 \\ge 1$, $x_2 \\ge 2$ returns the value $1$."
msgstr "**目标对齐。** 目标行由 `Obj_func::to_vector` 构造，它按变量名顺序只列出非零的目标系数。因此当某个目标系数为零，或变量没有按名字顺序声明（例如 `b` 在 `a` 之前，或 `x2` 在 `x10` 之前）时，求解器优化的是错误的目标。在 $x_1 \\ge 1$、$x_2 \\ge 2$ 约束下最小化 $x_2$，返回的值是 $1$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:442
msgid "**Artificial variables left in the basis.** When phase 1 ends with an artificial variable basic at value zero, phase 2 drops its column and loses that constraint. Maximising $x_1 - 2x_2$ subject to $-x_1 = 0$ and $x_1 \\le 2$ returns $x = (2, 0)$, which violates $-x_1 = 0$, and minimising $x_1 - x_2$ subject to $-x_2 = 0$ aborts with `Problem is unbounded`. Both programs have the optimum $0$ at $x = 0$."
msgstr "**人工变量留在基中。** 当第一阶段结束时某个人工变量以零值留在基中，第二阶段会丢弃它的列，从而丢失该约束。在 $-x_1 = 0$ 与 $x_1 \\le 2$ 约束下最大化 $x_1 - 2x_2$，返回 $x = (2, 0)$，违反 $-x_1 = 0$；在 $-x_2 = 0$ 约束下最小化 $x_1 - x_2$，则以 `Problem is unbounded` 中止。这两个规划的最优值都是 $0$，在 $x = 0$ 处取得。"

#: manual/api/core.md:443
msgid "**Starting basis with costs.** When a column of one of your own variables is already a unit column, it starts in the basis without an artificial variable, but the objective row is not made canonical before phase 1 runs on it. Minimising $-x_1 + 2x_2$ subject to $-x_1 + x_2 = 1$ aborts with `Problem is unbounded` instead of returning the optimum $2$ at $x = (0, 1)$."
msgstr "**带成本的初始基。** 当你自己某个变量的列已经是单位列时，它不经人工变量直接进入初始基，但在第一阶段运行之前目标行没有被化为典范形式。在 $-x_1 + x_2 = 1$ 约束下最小化 $-x_1 + 2x_2$，会以 `Problem is unbounded` 中止，而不是返回在 $x = (0, 1)$ 处的最优值 $2$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:444
msgid "**Cycling.** Degenerate programs can cycle until the iteration limit; see `Lp::simplex_iteration`."
msgstr "**循环。** 退化规划可能一直循环到迭代上限；见 `Lp::simplex_iteration`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:446
msgid "On random programs with one to three variables, small integer coefficients and non-zero objective coefficients, an exact-arithmetic replica of the solver gets about 5% of the bounded feasible programs wrong, all through the second and third defects."
msgstr "在含一到三个变量、小整数系数且目标系数非零的随机规划上，求解器的一个精确算术复刻在约 5% 的有界可行规划上出错，全部源于第二与第三条缺陷。"

#: manual/api/core.md:461
msgid "`pivot` performs one Gauss–Jordan pivot of a tableau in place."
msgstr "`pivot` 原地对单纯形表执行一次 Gauss–Jordan 主元变换。"

#: manual/api/core.md:467
msgid "`Lp::pivot(t, r, s)` divides row `r` by the pivot $t_{rs}$ and subtracts $t_{is}$ times the new row `r` from every other row `i`, including row 0, so that column `s` becomes the unit vector $e_r$. It aborts when the position lies outside the matrix or the pivot is exactly zero."
msgstr "`Lp::pivot(t, r, s)` 将第 `r` 行除以主元 $t_{rs}$，再从其他每一行 `i`（包括第 0 行）中减去新第 `r` 行的 $t_{is}$ 倍，使第 `s` 列成为单位向量 $e_r$。当位置超出矩阵或主元恰为零时会 abort。"

#: manual/api/core.md:471
msgid "`simplex_iteration` runs the simplex method on a tableau in place."
msgstr "`simplex_iteration` 原地在单纯形表上运行单纯形法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:477
msgid "The tableau must be in canonical form: row 0 holds the reduced costs and $-z$ in its last column, every basic column is a unit vector, and the right-hand sides are non-negative. Each iteration enters the column with the most negative entry of row 0 (the leftmost one on ties), and leaves the row with the smallest ratio $\\bar b_i / \\bar a_{is}$ over the rows with $\\bar a_{is} > 0$ (the topmost one on ties). The run stops when row 0 has no negative entry, aborts with `Problem is unbounded` when the entering column has no positive entry, and stops after `max_iterations` iterations (1000 by default) with a message. With `debug=true` it prints every pivot and the tableau after it."
msgstr "单纯形表必须处于典范形式：第 0 行存放检验数（约简成本），最后一列为 $-z$，每个基列都是单位向量，且右端项非负。每次迭代选择第 0 行中最负的项所在列进基（相同时取最左列），并在 $\\bar a_{is} > 0$ 的行中选择比值 $\\bar b_i / \\bar a_{is}$ 最小的行出基（相同时取最上面的行）。当第 0 行没有负项时停止；当进基列没有正项时以 `Problem is unbounded` abort；达到 `max_iterations` 次迭代（默认 1000）时打印消息并停止。设置 `debug=true` 时，会打印每次转轴及其后的单纯形表。"

#: manual/api/core.md:479
msgid "Dantzig's rule can cycle. On Beale's example the run returns to its starting basis every six degenerate pivots, so it stops at the iteration limit with the objective value $0$ ($-z$ in the last entry of row 0), while the optimum is $-5/4$:"
msgstr "Dantzig 规则可能循环。在 Beale 的例子上，运行每经过六次退化转轴就回到初始基，因此它停在迭代上限处，目标值为 $0$（即第 0 行最后一个元素中的 $-z$），而最优值是 $-5/4$："

#: manual/api/core.md:511
msgid "`phase_1` and `phase_2` are the two halves of `two_stage`."
msgstr "`phase_1` 与 `phase_2` 是 `two_stage` 的两个阶段。"

#: manual/api/core.md:518
msgid "`Lp::phase_1(t, artificial_index)` takes a tableau extended with artificial columns whose row 0 holds $1$ in each artificial column and $0$ elsewhere. `artificial_index[i]` is the column of the artificial variable of constraint `i`, or `0` when the constraint has none. It subtracts row `i + 1` from row 0 whenever row 0 holds exactly $1$ in column `artificial_index[i]`, which for the artificial rows puts the tableau in canonical form, then runs `simplex_iteration` and returns the same matrix. Because `0` also names column 0, a row without an artificial variable is subtracted as well whenever row 0 holds $1$ in column 0 at that moment. When no row needs an artificial variable, the private builder puts the program's own objective into row 0 instead, so phase 1 already optimises it, without making it canonical first."
msgstr "`Lp::phase_1(t, artificial_index)` 接受一个扩充了人工列的单纯形表，其第 0 行在每个人工列中为 $1$、其余为 $0$。`artificial_index[i]` 是约束 `i` 的人工变量所在的列，若该约束没有人工变量则为 `0`。只要第 0 行在第 `artificial_index[i]` 列恰好为 $1$，它就从第 0 行减去第 `i + 1` 行，这对人工行而言把单纯形表化为典范形式；然后调用 `simplex_iteration` 并返回同一个矩阵。由于 `0` 同时也指第 0 列，若此时第 0 行在第 0 列恰为 $1$，没有人工变量的行也会被减去。当没有任何行需要人工变量时，私有的构造函数会把规划自身的目标放进第 0 行，于是第一阶段直接优化它，但事先没有把它化为典范形式。"

#: manual/api/core.md:520
msgid "`Lp::phase_2(vars, c, t)` checks that phase 1 reached zero, copies the columns of the first `vars.length()` variables and the right-hand side into a new tableau, writes the objective `c` into row 0, eliminates the basic columns (recognised as columns equal to a unit vector, within `ApproximatelyZero`) from row 0, runs `simplex_iteration` and returns the basic solution together with the last entry of row 0, which is $-z$. It aborts with `W* from Phase1 isn't zero, Lp doesn't have solution` when phase 1 ended with a non-zero objective. A row whose basic variable after phase 1 is still an artificial one has no basic column in the new tableau; this is the cause of the second defect listed under `Lp::two_stage`."
msgstr "`Lp::phase_2(vars, c, t)` 检查第一阶段是否达到零，把前 `vars.length()` 个变量的列和右端项复制到一个新的单纯形表中，把目标 `c` 写入第 0 行，从第 0 行中消去基列（基列按在 `ApproximatelyZero` 容差内等于单位向量来识别），运行 `simplex_iteration`，并返回基本解以及第 0 行最后一个元素，即 $-z$。若第一阶段以非零目标结束，它以 `W* from Phase1 isn't zero, Lp doesn't have solution` 中止。第一阶段之后基变量仍是人工变量的行，在新表中没有基列；这就是 `Lp::two_stage` 下所列第二条缺陷的原因。"

#: manual/api/core.md:522
msgid "The helper that builds the phase 1 tableau and `artificial_index` from a program is private; use `two_stage` unless you build tableaux yourself."
msgstr "由规划构造第一阶段单纯形表和 `artificial_index` 的辅助函数是私有的；除非自己构造单纯形表，否则请使用 `two_stage`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:524
#: manual/design/core.md:186
msgid "Numeric tolerance"
msgstr "数值容差"

#: manual/api/core.md:528
msgid "`ApproximatelyZero` decides whether a value counts as zero in phase 2."
msgstr "`ApproximatelyZero` 判断某个值在第二阶段中是否算作零。"

#: manual/api/core.md:538
msgid "An `Int` is zero only when it equals `0`. A `Double` is zero when $|x| < 10^{-15}$, an absolute threshold."
msgstr "`Int` 只有等于 `0` 时才算零。`Double` 在 $|x| < 10^{-15}$ 时算零，这是一个绝对阈值。"

#: manual/api/core.md:540
msgid "The trait is declared `pub`, not `pub(open)`, so it is read-only outside this package: other packages cannot implement it for their own types. `Lp::two_stage` and `Lp::phase_2` therefore accept only `Int` and `Double` coefficients, and `Int` gives wrong results because its division truncates."
msgstr "该 trait 声明为 `pub` 而非 `pub(open)`，因此在包外是只读的：其他包无法为自己的类型实现它。所以 `Lp::two_stage` 与 `Lp::phase_2` 只接受 `Int` 与 `Double` 系数，而 `Int` 的除法会截断，结果是错误的。"

#: manual/api/core.md:544
msgid "`double_equal_to_zero` calls `is_zero_eps`."
msgstr "`double_equal_to_zero` 调用 `is_zero_eps`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:558
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已弃用"

