msgid "This manual documents the `v0.1.0` release of `linear-program`, as migrated to MoonBit 0.10 on `main`."
msgstr "本手册记录 `linear-program` 的 `v0.1.0` 版本，即 `main` 上迁移到 MoonBit 0.10 后的状态。"

