msgid "[![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/Maintainer-KCN--judu-violet)](https://github.com/KCN-judu) [![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/Collaborator-CAIMEOX-purple)](https://github.com/CAIMEOX) [![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Apache%202.0-blue)](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/linear-program/blob/main/LICENSE) ![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/State-active-success)"
msgstr "[![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/Maintainer-KCN--judu-violet)](https://github.com/KCN-judu) [![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/Collaborator-CAIMEOX-purple)](https://github.com/CAIMEOX) [![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Apache%202.0-blue)](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/linear-program/blob/main/LICENSE) ![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/State-active-success)"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "linear-program is a [MoonBit](https://www.moonbitlang.com/) library for writing linear programs and solving them with the two-phase simplex method. Coefficients are generic over the algebraic traits of [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/), and the simplex tableau is a mutable matrix from [linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/). Every step of the solver is public, so the library also serves to follow the simplex method by hand."
msgstr "linear-program 是一个用于编写线性规划并以两阶段单纯形法求解的 [MoonBit](https://www.moonbitlang.com/) 库。系数在 [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 的代数 trait 上泛型，单纯形表是 [linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/) 的可变矩阵。求解器的每一步都是公开的，因此该库也可用来手动跟踪单纯形法。"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "The solver is a teaching implementation. It handles small, well-scaled programs with `Double` coefficients, but it has known defects that can make it report a wrong optimum, a point that violates a constraint, or a false \"unbounded\"; the [API](api/core.md) marks each with a warning and the [design notes](design/core.md#known-defects) explain them."
msgstr "该求解器是一个教学实现。它能处理系数为 `Double`、规模小且尺度良好的规划，但存在已知缺陷，可能报告错误的最优值、违反约束的点或虚假的“无界”；[API](api/core.md) 用警告逐一标出，[设计说明](design/core.md#known-defects)解释其原因。"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "The module is named `linear-program`, without the `Luna-Flow/` namespace, so it is not published as `Luna-Flow/linear-program` on mooncakes yet and `moon add` cannot fetch it. Use a local checkout instead: add it, together with checkouts of `luna-generic` and `linear-algebra`, to the `members` of your `moon.work`, and list it in the `import` block of your `moon.mod`:"
msgstr "模块名为 `linear-program`，没有 `Luna-Flow/` 命名空间，因此尚未以 `Luna-Flow/linear-program` 发布到 mooncakes，`moon add` 无法获取它。请改用本地检出：把它与 `luna-generic`、`linear-algebra` 的检出一起加入 `moon.work` 的 `members`，并在 `moon.mod` 的 `import` 块中列出它："

#: manual/index.md:24
msgid "Then import `\"linear-program\"` in your `moon.pkg`; the [tutorial](tutorial/core.md#quick-start) shows the complete setup. The library needs the MoonBit toolchain 0.10 or later (`moonc` ≥ 0.10) and depends on `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 0.3.3 and `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` 0.4.7."
msgstr "然后在 `moon.pkg` 中导入 `\"linear-program\"`；[教程](tutorial/core.md#quick-start)给出完整配置。本库需要 MoonBit 工具链 0.10 或更高版本（`moonc` ≥ 0.10），并依赖 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 0.3.3 与 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` 0.4.7。"

