#: manual/index.md:37
msgid "`Variable`: a named decision variable; its bounds are stored but not enforced"
msgstr "`Variable`：带名字的决策变量；其上下界会被保存但不会被强制"

#: manual/index.md:38
msgid "`Poly`: a linear expression, a map from variables to non-zero coefficients"
msgstr "`Poly`：线性表达式，即从变量到非零系数的映射"

#: manual/index.md:39
msgid "`Obj_func`: an objective, a `Poly` with the sense `min` or `max`"
msgstr "`Obj_func`：目标函数，即带有 `min` 或 `max` 方向的 `Poly`"

#: manual/index.md:40
msgid "`Constraint`: equalities and `<=` / `>=` inequalities"
msgstr "`Constraint`：等式与 `<=` / `>=` 不等式"

#: manual/index.md:42
msgid "Programs and standard form"
msgstr "规划与标准形"

#: manual/index.md:44
msgid "`Lp`: a program with its variables, objective, constraints and program matrix"
msgstr "`Lp`：由变量、目标、约束与规划矩阵组成的规划"

#: manual/index.md:45
msgid "`Lp::new`, `Lp::cons_from_Array`, `Lp::reset_obj_byarray`, `Lp::from_matrix`: build a program"
msgstr "`Lp::new`、`Lp::cons_from_Array`、`Lp::reset_obj_byarray`、`Lp::from_matrix`：构造规划"

#: manual/index.md:46
msgid "`Lp::to_standard`: rewrite it as $\\min c^\\top x$, $Ax = b$, $b \\ge 0$, $x \\ge 0$"
msgstr "`Lp::to_standard`：把规划改写为 $\\min c^\\top x$，$Ax = b$，$b \\ge 0$，$x \\ge 0$"

#: manual/index.md:47
msgid "`Lp::get_coeff_matrix`, `Lp::get_objfunc_vector`, `Lp::get_b_vector`: read $A$, $c$, $b$"
msgstr "`Lp::get_coeff_matrix`、`Lp::get_objfunc_vector`、`Lp::get_b_vector`：读取 $A$、$c$、$b$"

#: manual/index.md:49
msgid "Solver"
msgstr "求解器"

#: manual/index.md:51
msgid "`Lp::two_stage`: the two-phase simplex method on a program in standard form"
msgstr "`Lp::two_stage`：对标准形规划执行两阶段单纯形法"

#: manual/index.md:52
msgid "`Lp::pivot`, `Lp::simplex_iteration`, `Lp::phase_1`, `Lp::phase_2`: its steps, public for teaching"
msgstr "`Lp::pivot`、`Lp::simplex_iteration`、`Lp::phase_1`、`Lp::phase_2`：它的各个步骤，为教学而公开"

#: manual/index.md:53
msgid "`ApproximatelyZero`, `double_equal_to_zero`: the zero test of phase 2, implemented for `Int` and `Double`"
msgstr "`ApproximatelyZero`、`double_equal_to_zero`：第二阶段的零判断，为 `Int` 与 `Double` 实现"

#: manual/index.md:55
msgid "Where to read next"
msgstr "接下来读什么"

#: manual/index.md:57
msgid "The [tutorial](tutorial/core.md) solves a production problem, a minimisation with `>=` constraints and a program given as a matrix, then pivots a tableau by hand. The [API reference](api/core.md) states the exact behaviour of every function, including what aborts, and the [design notes](design/core.md) derive standard form, reduced costs, the stopping tests and the two phases."
msgstr "[教程](tutorial/core.md)求解一个生产问题、一个带 `>=` 约束的最小化问题和一个以矩阵给出的规划，然后手动对单纯形表转轴。[API 参考](api/core.md)给出每个函数的确切行为，包括何时中止；[设计说明](design/core.md)推导标准形、检验数、停止判据与两个阶段。"

#: manual/index.md:59
msgid "New to linear programming: work through the [tutorial](tutorial/core.md), and keep the [design notes](design/core.md) open for the meaning of standard form, reduced costs and the two phases."
msgstr "初学线性规划：完整学习[教程](tutorial/core.md)，并对照[设计说明](design/core.md)理解标准形、检验数与两个阶段的含义。"

#: manual/index.md:60
msgid "Using the solver in a library: read the warnings in the [API reference](api/core.md) and the [common pitfalls](tutorial/core.md#common-pitfalls), and check every result against the constraints, as the tutorial shows."
msgstr "在库中使用求解器：阅读 [API 参考](api/core.md)中的警告与[常见陷阱](tutorial/core.md#common-pitfalls)，并像教程所示那样用约束检验每个结果。"

#: manual/index.md:61
msgid "Contributing: read the [design notes](design/core.md), especially the invariants and the known defects, then the [contribution guidelines](contributing.md)."
msgstr "参与贡献：阅读[设计说明](design/core.md)，特别是不变式与已知缺陷，然后阅读[贡献指南](contributing.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:63
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "校验"

#: manual/index.md:65
msgid "Recommended release checks, from the repository root (or run `ready_to_pr.sh`):"
msgstr "推荐的发布检查，在仓库根目录下执行（或运行 `ready_to_pr.sh`）："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:1
msgid "core tutorial"
msgstr "core 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to write a linear program, bring it into standard form and solve it with the two-phase simplex method of linear-program. It starts with a two-variable production problem and ends with driving the simplex method by hand on a tableau. The mathematics behind each step is in the [design notes](../design/core.md)."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何编写线性规划、将其化为标准形，并用 linear-program 的两阶段单纯形法求解。它从一个两变量的生产问题开始，最后在单纯形表上手动执行单纯形法。每一步背后的数学见[设计说明](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:5
msgid "I want to"
msgstr "我想要"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:5
msgid "Use"
msgstr "使用"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:7
msgid "declare decision variables"
msgstr "声明决策变量"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:7
msgid "`Variable::new(name, lower, upper)`; only $x \\ge 0$ is enforced"
msgstr "`Variable::new(name, lower, upper)`；只强制 $x \\ge 0$"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:8
msgid "state the objective"
msgstr "给出目标"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:9
msgid "state the constraints"
msgstr "给出约束"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:10
msgid "give an equality-only program as one matrix"
msgstr "把只含等式的规划写成一个矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "solve it"
msgstr "求解"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "`lp.to_standard().two_stage()`, negating the value for `max`"
msgstr "`lp.to_standard().two_stage()`，对 `max` 取值的相反数"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:12
msgid "see $A$, $b$ and $c$ of the standard form"
msgstr "查看标准形的 $A$、$b$ 与 $c$"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "follow the simplex method step by step"
msgstr "逐步跟踪单纯形法"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "`Lp::pivot` and `Lp::simplex_iteration` on a tableau"
msgstr "在单纯形表上使用 `Lp::pivot` 与 `Lp::simplex_iteration`"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:14
msgid "trust a result"
msgstr "信任一个结果"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:14
msgid "substitute it into the constraints, as in [check the result yourself](#check-the-result-yourself)"
msgstr "把它代入约束检验，如[自行检验结果](#check-the-result-yourself)所示"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:16
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:18
msgid "The module is named `linear-program`, without the `Luna-Flow/` namespace, and is not published on mooncakes under the Luna-Flow organisation yet. Use it from a local checkout: add the checkout, together with checkouts of its dependencies [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) and [linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/), to the `members` of your `moon.work`, and list it in the `import` block of your `moon.mod`:"
msgstr "该模块名为 `linear-program`，没有 `Luna-Flow/` 命名空间，目前也尚未以 Luna-Flow 组织的名义发布到 mooncakes。请从本地检出使用：把该检出及其依赖 [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 与 [linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/) 的检出加入 `moon.work` 的 `members`，并在 `moon.mod` 的 `import` 块中列出它："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:27
msgid "Then import the package in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "然后在 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:37
msgid "The smallest useful program maximises $3x_1 + 4x_2$ subject to $2x_1 + x_2 \\le 12$, $x_1 + 3x_2 \\le 10$ and $x_1, x_2 \\ge 0$:"
msgstr "最小的实用程序在 $2x_1 + x_2 \\le 12$、$x_1 + 3x_2 \\le 10$ 和 $x_1, x_2 \\ge 0$ 的约束下最大化 $3x_1 + 4x_2$："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:52
msgid "The optimum is $x_1 = 5.2$, $x_2 = 1.6$ with value $22$, up to rounding. The solution has four entries because `to_standard` adds one slack variable per inequality, and the value is negated because the standard form minimises $-3x_1 - 4x_2$."
msgstr "最优解为 $x_1 = 5.2$、$x_2 = 1.6$，最优值为 $22$（忽略舍入误差）。解有四个分量，是因为 `to_standard` 为每个不等式添加了一个松弛变量；值取了负号，是因为标准形最小化的是 $-3x_1 - 4x_2$。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:54
msgid "Everyday tasks"
msgstr "日常任务"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:56
msgid "Write a program and read it back"
msgstr "编写规划并读回"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:58
msgid "Variables carry a name and bounds; the objective carries a sense and coefficients; constraints are rows of coefficients. `Show` prints the program in the usual notation:"
msgstr "变量带有名称和边界；目标函数带有优化方向和系数；约束是系数行。`Show` 以常见记法打印规划："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:86
msgid "An equality row is `(coefficients, b)`; an inequality row is `(coefficients, relation, b)` with the relation written exactly as `\">=\"` or `\"<=\"`. The `nonneg` helper is used by the remaining examples."
msgstr "等式行为 `(coefficients, b)`；不等式行为 `(coefficients, relation, b)`，关系必须恰好写作 `\">=\"` 或 `\"<=\"`。后续示例都会用到辅助函数 `nonneg`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:88
msgid "Bring a program into standard form"
msgstr "将规划化为标准形"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:90
msgid "The solver works on $\\min c^\\top x$ subject to $Ax = b$, $b \\ge 0$, $x \\ge 0$. `to_standard` produces it, and the accessors return $c$, $A$ and $b$:"
msgstr "求解器处理的是在 $Ax = b$、$b \\ge 0$、$x \\ge 0$ 约束下的 $\\min c^\\top x$。`to_standard` 生成这种形式，访问函数返回 $c$、$A$ 和 $b$："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:113
msgid "Each `>=` row received a surplus variable with coefficient $-1$, so $2x_1 + x_2 \\ge 12$ became $2x_1 + x_2 - y_1 = 12$ with $y_1 \\ge 0$."
msgstr "每个 `>=` 行都获得了一个系数为 $-1$ 的剩余变量，因此 $2x_1 + x_2 \\ge 12$ 变成了 $2x_1 + x_2 - y_1 = 12$，且 $y_1 \\ge 0$。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:115
msgid "Solve a minimisation problem"
msgstr "求解最小化问题"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:117
msgid "A minimisation problem needs no sign change: the returned value is the minimum."
msgstr "最小化问题不需要变号：返回值就是最小值。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:130
msgid "No slack column is a unit column here, so phase 1 adds two artificial variables, drives them to zero, and phase 2 then minimises the real objective from the feasible point phase 1 found."
msgstr "这里没有任何松弛列是单位列，因此第一阶段添加两个人工变量并将其驱动到零，随后第二阶段从第一阶段找到的可行点出发最小化真正的目标。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:132
msgid "Write a program with equality constraints as a matrix"
msgstr "用矩阵编写含等式约束的规划"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:134
msgid "When every constraint is an equality, the whole program fits in one matrix: row 0 holds the objective coefficients and every further row holds one constraint $[a_i \\mid b_i]$. This program minimises $-x_1 - 2x_2 - 3x_3$ subject to $x_1 + 2x_2 + 3x_3 = 10$ and $2x_1 + x_2 + x_3 = 8$:"
msgstr "当所有约束都是等式时，整个规划可以放进一个矩阵：第 0 行存放目标系数，其后每行存放一个约束 $[a_i \\mid b_i]$。下面的规划在 $x_1 + 2x_2 + 3x_3 = 10$ 与 $2x_1 + x_2 + x_3 = 8$ 的约束下最小化 $-x_1 - 2x_2 - 3x_3$："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:161
msgid "The optimum is $x = (2, 4, 0)$ with value $-10$. The last entry of row 0 is ignored by `from_matrix`."
msgstr "最优解为 $x = (2, 4, 0)$，最优值为 $-10$。`from_matrix` 会忽略第 0 行的最后一项。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:163
msgid "Build expressions term by term"
msgstr "逐项构造表达式"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:165
msgid "`Poly` and `Obj_func` can also be built one term at a time, which is convenient when coefficients come from data:"
msgstr "`Poly` 与 `Obj_func` 也可以逐项构造，这在系数来自数据时很方便："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:182
msgid "`add_term_inplace` adds to an existing coefficient, so `x1` ends with $3 + 1 = 4$."
msgstr "`add_term_inplace` 会累加到已有系数上，因此 `x1` 最终为 $3 + 1 = 4$。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:184
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "进阶"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:186
msgid "Drive the simplex method by hand"
msgstr "手动执行单纯形法"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:188
msgid "The steps of `two_stage` are public. When a program is already in canonical form, for example because every constraint is `<=` with $b \\ge 0$ and the slack columns form an identity, you can write the tableau yourself and pivot on it. Row 0 holds the reduced costs and $-z$:"
msgstr "`two_stage` 的各个步骤都是公开的。当规划已经处于典范形式时（例如所有约束都是 $b \\ge 0$ 的 `<=`，且松弛列构成单位矩阵），你可以自己写出单纯形表并在其上转轴。第 0 行存放检验数和 $-z$："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:214
msgid "After the first pivot the objective has improved from $0$ to $40/3$; the remaining negative reduced cost of $x_1$ says that one more pivot improves it further, to $22$. Pass `debug=true` to `simplex_iteration` to print every pivot."
msgstr "第一次转轴之后，目标从 $0$ 改进到 $40/3$；$x_1$ 仍有负的检验数，说明再转轴一次可以进一步改进到 $22$。向 `simplex_iteration` 传入 `debug=true` 可以打印每次转轴。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:216
msgid "Coefficient types"
msgstr "系数类型"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:218
msgid "Every function is generic in the coefficient type `V`, and the modelling functions (`Variable`, `Poly`, `Obj_func`, `Constraint`, `Lp::to_standard`) work with any type that has the luna-generic traits they ask for. The solver also needs `ApproximatelyZero`, which is read-only outside the package: only `Int` and `Double` implement it, and you cannot add your own exact number type. Since integer division truncates, use `Double` for `two_stage`."
msgstr "每个函数对系数类型 `V` 都是泛型的，建模函数（`Variable`、`Poly`、`Obj_func`、`Constraint`、`Lp::to_standard`）适用于任何具备它们所要求的 luna-generic trait 的类型。求解器还需要 `ApproximatelyZero`，它在包外是只读的：只有 `Int` 与 `Double` 实现了它，你无法加入自己的精确数类型。由于整数除法会截断，请对 `two_stage` 使用 `Double`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:220
msgid "Check the result yourself"
msgstr "自行检查结果"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:222
msgid "`two_stage` aborts on infeasible and unbounded programs instead of returning an error, so validate the input before calling it when the program comes from user data. After solving, substitute the solution back into the constraints of the standard form to confirm feasibility:"
msgstr "`two_stage` 遇到不可行和无界的规划时会 abort 而不是返回错误，因此当规划来自用户数据时，请在调用前验证输入。求解之后，把解代回标准形的约束以确认可行性："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:243
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:245
msgid "**The returned value belongs to the standard form.** `to_standard` turns every program into a minimisation, so for a maximisation problem negate the value returned by `two_stage`."
msgstr "**返回值属于标准形。** `to_standard` 把每个规划都变成最小化问题，因此对于最大化问题，请对 `two_stage` 的返回值取负。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:246
msgid "**The solution includes slack variables.** Its length is the number of variables of the standard form; your own variables come first, in declaration order."
msgstr "**解包含松弛变量。** 其长度是标准形的变量个数；你自己的变量按声明顺序排在最前面。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:247
msgid "**Objective coefficients must line up.** Because of a known defect, the objective row is filled from the non-zero coefficients in the order of the variable names. Give every variable a non-zero objective coefficient and declare variables in name order (`x1`, `x2`, ..., not `x2` before `x10`), or the solver optimises a different objective."
msgstr "**目标系数必须对齐。** 由于一个已知缺陷，目标行是按变量名顺序由非零系数填充的。请给每个变量一个非零目标系数，并按名称顺序声明变量（`x1`、`x2`……，不要把 `x2` 放在 `x10` 之前），否则求解器会优化另一个目标。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:248
msgid "**Bounds are not enforced.** `Variable::new(\"x\", 0.0, 100.0)` stores the bound $100$, but the solver only assumes $x \\ge 0$. Add an explicit constraint `([1.0, ...], \"<=\", 100.0)` for an upper bound."
msgstr "**边界不会被实施。** `Variable::new(\"x\", 0.0, 100.0)` 保存了上界 $100$，但求解器只假定 $x \\ge 0$。如需上界，请显式添加约束 `([1.0, ...], \"<=\", 100.0)`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:249
msgid "**Infeasible and unbounded programs abort.** There is no `Result` to inspect."
msgstr "**不可行和无界的规划会 abort。** 没有可供检查的 `Result`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:250
msgid "**Use `Double` coefficients.** `Int` satisfies the trait bounds, but integer division truncates, so pivoting on `Int` gives wrong results."
msgstr "**使用 `Double` 系数。** `Int` 满足 trait 约束，但整数除法会截断，因此在 `Int` 上转轴会得到错误结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:251
msgid "**Tolerance is absolute.** Phase 2 treats $|x| < 10^{-15}$ as zero. For programs with large coefficients, rounding errors can exceed this threshold and an infeasibility can be reported for a feasible program; rescale the rows so that coefficients are of moderate size."
msgstr "**容差是绝对的。** 第二阶段把 $|x| < 10^{-15}$ 视为零。对于系数较大的规划，舍入误差可能超过该阈值，可行的规划可能被报告为不可行；请缩放各行，使系数大小适中。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:252
msgid "**Do not name variables `y1`, `y2`, ...** `to_standard` uses these names for slack variables, and variables are identified by name."
msgstr "**不要把变量命名为 `y1`、`y2`……** `to_standard` 用这些名称表示松弛变量，而变量是按名称识别的。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:253
msgid "**Some feasible bounded programs fail.** When phase 1 leaves an artificial variable in the basis, or when one of your own variables already has a unit column, the solver can return a point that violates a constraint or abort with `Problem is unbounded`. The warning under [`Lp::two_stage`](../api/core.md#lptwo_stage) gives small examples; equality constraints with right-hand side $0$ are a typical trigger. Check every solution against the constraints."
msgstr "**有些可行且有界的规划会失败。** 当第一阶段把人工变量留在基中，或你自己的某个变量已经有单位列时，求解器可能返回违反约束的点，或以 `Problem is unbounded` 中止。[`Lp::two_stage`](../api/core.md#lptwo_stage) 下的警告给出了小例子；右端项为 $0$ 的等式约束是典型的诱因。请用约束检验每个解。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:254
msgid "**Degenerate programs can cycle.** A run that hits the iteration limit prints a message and returns a non-optimal result without an error."
msgstr "**退化规划可能循环。** 达到迭代上限的运行会打印一条消息，并在不报错的情况下返回非最优结果。"

